        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mubuzuba obo lunyungu lwa-Jese, ilwakabeda bamasi citondezyo, bamasi bayooyandaula ndulo, nkabela cilyokezezyo cakwe ciyooba abulemu.",
          "type": "text",
